    "body": "After discussion in the UDB PR meeting, we determined this check really should be:\n\n```\nif (implemented?(ExtensionName::A) && MISA_CSR_IMPLEMENTED && CSR[misa].A == 1'b0) {\n  reserved_instruction($encoding);\n}\n```\n\nwhere `reserved_instruction` is a function in globals.isa (this is hand-written, probably won't compile):\n\n```\nfunction reserved_instruction {\n  arguments Bits<INSTR_ENC_LENGTH> encoding\n  body {\n    if (TRAP_ON_UNIMPLEMENTED_INSTRUCTION) {\n      raise(ExceptionCode::IllegalInstruction, encoding, mode());\n    } else {\n      unpredictable(\"Unimplemented instruction that does not trap\");\n    }\n  }\n}\n```",
